   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DCAD MEMBERSHIP FOR JULY 2025 TO JUNE 2026 PERIOD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Donor Committee on Enterprise Development (DCED) is a forum for learning about the most effective ways to support sustainable development in the Global South through Private Sector Development (PSD). The Committee convenes donors, international organisations and development partners in peer-to-peer learning events and through thematic working groups within PSD. It also produces guidance papers and commissions research and evidence on PSD activities. DCED supports the BEAM Exchange &#x2013; a platform for knowledge exchange and a resource hub for building effective and accessible markets in developing countries. One of DCED initiatives is their promotion of  their  Green Growth Working Group covering both the integration of environmental sustainability and climete change mitagation and adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
